<p>2020</p>

<p>2023</p>

<p>In September, local processor Prairie Farms Dairy, Inc. announced the closing of its milk processing operation in Bismarck. The facility would revert to warehouse / distribution only. The additional shipping costs associated with transportation to the Fargo area for sale forced the elimination of most dairy farms in the area.</p>
